window.products.push({"id":989160,"name":"Old World Christmas Thanksgiving Glass Blown Ornaments for Christmas Tree Tom Turkey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MrSr046rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Turkey symbolizes altruism and self-sacrifice. It is the centerpiece of today s Thanksgiving dinner, which commemorates the first Thanksgiving in 1621, when the Pilgrims and Native Americans shared a harvest meal. Ben Franklin championed the turkey as our national symbol, but the bald eagle won!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MrSr046rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Old World Christmas","source_asin":"B07ZLFVSGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZLFVSGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZLFVSGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":989161,"name":"Classic Brands Individually Wrapped Coils Innerspring Pillow Top 10-Inch Mattress for Added Comfort and Support, Twin XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xYQvR7L9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Classic Brands Pillow-Top Innerspring 10-Inch Mattress is constructed with tempered steel wrapped innerspring coils that improve the mattresses durability and longevity. The Classic innerspring mattress is an excellent value for a supportive and undisturbed sleep for years to come. The 10-inch profile Pillow-Top Innerspring Mattress has the ultimate support of a wrapped steel coil innerspring at the right price! The 7-inches of 13 Gage individually wrapped coils are encased in separate pockets so they can contour precisely to your body. Individually wrapped coil innerspring system moves independently and reduces the sensation of movement on a bed providing contouring comfort and support for an undisturbed night's sleep. There are two cushioning fiber layers on top and beneath the coils, which provide a buffer, so you never feel the coils, even after years of use. Individually Wrapped Coils Our 10-inch pillow-top mattress consists of innerspring individual coils wrapped in a fabric designed to minimize friction and maximize support. The 13-gauge steel coils tend to provide consistent distribution of support throughout the mattress and lessens motion transfer for sleep partners. Individually wrapped coils move independently and are encased in separate pockets so they can contour precisely to each person and provide, deep, comforting pressure relief, independent of body type. Comfort and Durability Our 10-inch pillow-top mattress is both comfortable and durable. Overall, individually wrapped coils offer superior comfort and pressure relief over a traditional coil system. Although a traditional coil can be very comfortable when paired with the proper pressure relieving comfort layers, an individually wrapped coil is superior due to its ability to provide individualized contouring and motion separation for undisturbed rest. Also, wrapped coils are extremely durable and will last for years. They do not wear down over time making them a great support system for your body. Get it Right the First Time It is also a good idea to know the size and the height of your mattress ahead of time to make sure you are ordering the correct size. Keep in mind that you should combine the height of your bed frame, foundation, or adjustable bed base with the height of your mattress to get a gauge of the how tall your sleep system will be. Twin Size - 39\" W x 75\" L x 10\" H Twin XL Size - 39\" W x 80\" L x 10\" H Full Size - 54\" W x 75\" L x 10\" H Queen Size – 60\" W x 80\" L x 10\" H King Size – 76\" W x 80\" L x 10\" H California King Size – 72\" W x 84\" L x 10\" H Classic Brands Smart Packaging Classic Brands also uses Smart Packaging. Smart packaging reduces the carbon footprint in the manufacturers shipping process. Our advanced packaging technology means we can roll-pack our mattresses and ship them at one-third of the normal size. As a result of this process, we can ship more mattresses per delivery and reduce the amount of carbon emissions. A mattress that is roll-packed still retains its initial quality, as each will quickly recover and return to its original shape after being removed from its packaging. Quality Assurance The Classic Brands Pillow-Top Innerspring 10-inch mattress is backed with a worry-free 10-year warranty. Look for more innovative specialty sleep products from Classic Brands","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xYQvR7L9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Classic Brands","source_asin":"B083YMLSS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083YMLSS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083YMLSS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":989162,"name":"Paine's Incense Refill 70 Balsam FIR Sticks 2 Lodge Style Sachet Scented Pine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418uk2J4DVL._AC_.jpg","description":"70 genuine 2\" BALSAM FIR INCENSE STICKS (does not come with burner). We sell more balsam fir products as well as the pillows in our ebay store). These sticks do not fit the log cabins - for the log cabins you need to buy our logs (see ebay store). Made in Maine since 1931, Paine's Balsam Fir Incense smells like the holidays—and for good reason. The company collects balsam branches from local woodsmen, then grinds, dries, and shapes those into sticks and cones that'll fill your home with the scent of evergreens, whether you have a real Christmas tree or not. Paine's incense is made in Auburn, Maine. First, balsam branches are brought to us by local woodsmen, where they are then ground and dried. It is next pressed into incense molds and finally dried… That’s it! No chemicals are added to our incense, and is 100% natural and sustainable! We also use the balsam in our pillows. We make souvenir pillows that are stuffed with the balsam fir. They are great as gifts, or an aromatic delight in a drawer, closet, or car.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418uk2J4DVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paine's","source_asin":"B01N3XTO89","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N3XTO89","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N3XTO89","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
