window.products.push({"id":989165,"name":"Pimpernel Botanic Garden Collection Placemats | Set of 4 | Heat Resistant Mats | Cork-Backed Board | Hard Placemat Set for Dining Table | Measures 15.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715CVKSqSmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cork Imported INCREDIBLE ARTISTRY: A true British classic, the mix and match of Botanic Garden's floral motifs, inspired by 19th century botanical illustrations, bring a bit of the garden to your table. STRONG AND STYLISH: Our quality placemats and coasters use a 5mm board topped with a unique and exclusive art print. Each is totally sealed with a high quality coating that is both stain and heat resistant to 212 degrees Celsius. The placemats and coasters are then finished with a hard-wearing cork back that protects precious furniture. SOMETHING FOR EVERYONE: Pimpernel is the premier brand for placemats, coasters, trays and accessories, with an outstanding and unique range that is renowned for its high quality. Pimpernel's exclusive homewares, textiles and gifts are created to suit all tastes, and make wonderful additions to the home. TIMELESS DESIGNS: Portmeirion was founded by legendary ceramic designer Susan William-Ellis in 1960 and has remained at the forefront of contemporary design ever since. Renowned for our tableware and giftware, Portmeirion produces beautiful and unique collections all of which are made to the highest standard to be enjoyed every day. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: Package contains (1) Pimpernel Botanic Garden Collection Placemats - Set of 4. Made of Cork-Backed Board. Each Placemat measures 15.7 inches x 11.7 inches. Product Care: Clean with a damp sponge and dry with a soft cloth. Do not immerse in water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715CVKSqSmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pimpernel","source_asin":"B004UL9L0U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989165","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004UL9L0U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004UL9L0U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
