window.products.push({"id":989183,"name":"Air Purifier for Home Bedroom, True HEPA Filter for Smokers, Large Room Air Cleaner Removes 99.97% Allergies, Pets Dander, Hair, Pollen, Dust, Quiet F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dwLu-H-dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Advanced 3-Stage Filtration】Air purifier for home is designed with 3-stage filtration system that captures 99.97% of airborne particles as small as 0.3 microns in size. Pre-filter captures larger particles like dust, hair and pet fur. True HEPA filter traps airborne allergens like pet dander . Activated carbon filter absorbs light household odors from pets, cooking, smoking and VOCs. Ideal gifts for your family and loved ones! 【Effective Air Purification】CADR 135CFM / 230m³/h, this air purifier for large room quickly circulates air in rooms up to 302ft² / 28m². Compact frame of 8.6 x 8.6 x 14.2 inch and 360° air intake fit right in wherever you put it, from small to large rooms, bedrooms, living rooms and offices. This room air cleaner is available for California, CARB passed (G-21-040), which is perfect for pet owners, allergics to breathe refreshing air. Decorate your home with fresh air in daily life. 【Quiet Sleep Mode】With noise levels as low as 25dB, this air purifier for bedroom cleans your air under sleep mode, so that you could enjoy easier breathing and uninterrupted sleep as it eliminates the odors from pets and smokers whisper-quietly. Note: 100% ozone free. Does not use UVC light or ions which produce an air pollutant or measurable ozone, which is especially harmful for the children and Asthma sufferers. Perfect air purifier for your gift lists. 【Clear Touch Panel】Easy to customize your ideal settings. 4 timer options (2H/4H/6H/8H) allow you set operating time. 4 fan speeds from sleep, low, medium to high to capture as much air pollutants as required. Lightweight, compact yet portable, you can easily move this small room air purifier to any space. Trusted to keep your loved ones safe. This large room air purifier is perfect for homes, apartments, bedrooms, living rooms, offices, schools, universities, classrooms, dorms, and more. 【Safe Child Lock & Filter Change Reminder】Ozone-free, approved by CARB and ETL listed, Aroma Room home air purifier comes with a 12-Month warranty. Child Lock button prevents error operations accidentally caused by pet or children out of curiosity. Bulit-in filter change indicator will light up to remind you to check and replace the filter to maintain better performance. TIPS: Please remove the plastic bag of the HEPA filter before running the air purifier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dwLu-H-dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aroma Room","source_asin":"B08R7H7DYK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R7H7DYK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R7H7DYK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
