window.products.push({"id":989379,"name":"DEAYOU 24 Cups Egg Tray Holder, 4 Pack Porcelain Egg Keeper Storage Container for Countertop, Ceramic Half Dozen Little Eggs Dispenser Organizer Serve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NrkaT82tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Value Pack and Compact Size: Coming with 4 packs of porcelain 6-cup egg holder tray in chic black color. Product measures approx. 5.7\" length x 3.9\" width x 1.2\" height. The little size to move conveniently and take up minimal countertop or fridge space. The sufficient quantity to meet your diverse using and replacing needs Healthy Porcelain: Our egg containers are made of premium high-fired solid porcelain, cadmium free and lead free, food-grade and non-toxic, sturdy and scratch-resistant. The nonporous glazed interior will not react to food. The impermeable external enamel can resist metal stains. Very healthy and high-end serveware for your home Wide Applications: DEAYOU ceramic egg tray holders are not only perfect for storing raw eggs, hard-boiled eggs, mini appetizers at home, kitchen, restaurants, hotels, bakeries, schools, but also great for displaying classic easter chick deviled eggs, dyed eggs, painted eggs at Easter celebrations or laying out traditional favorites at parties Practical and Contemporary Design: Our ceramic egg keeper features with 6 round slots which are just the right size to hold standard-size chicken eggs or your favorite cakes. The classic shape with glossy polished finish surface makes these porcelain egg trays the exquisite centerpieces and decent decors for any kinds of house styles Easy to Use and Clean: These mini ceramic egg holders are microwave, oven, dishwasher, refrigerator, disinfection cabinet safe. You can also use them during baking to keep eggs rolling off the countertop. The smooth surface makes them easy to release food and simple to clean, just wash with scouring pad and soapy water","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NrkaT82tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEAYOU","source_asin":"B09BTV67V4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989379","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BTV67V4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BTV67V4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
