window.products.push({"id":989484,"name":"Dalstrong Serbian Chef Knife - 8 inch - Meat Cleaver - Shogun Series ELITE - Japanese AUS-10V Super Steel Kitchen Knife - G10 Handle - Sheath Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u7CMqnkuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Shogun 8″ Serbian Chef Knife takes its inspiration from the region of its origin, with our trademark Shogun twist. An innovative hybrid between a chef knife and a cleaver, its curved spine and straight edge make it an indispensable workhorse in the kitchen — ideal for slicing meat, dicing vegetables, mincing herbs, or chopping nuts. Precision-forged from a single piece of Japanese high-carbon solid AUS-10V steel, the advanced cryogenic tempering enhances strength, flexibility, and hardness. Sharpened to 8-12 degrees with the Honbazuke 3-step method, the beautiful mirror-polished edge has exceptionally long-lasting edge retention. The G10 camouflage handle is triple-riveted and built to withstand even the most vigorous slicing, dicing, and cutting. Enjoy the comfort of its rugged grip, resistant to both extreme hot and cold temperatures for long-term durability. A premium-quality polymer Dalstrong PerfectFit saya (sheath) with an embossed Dalstrong logo and pin is included with the set to ensure your blade is carefully protected. Dalstrong Trust: Rocksolid 100% SATISFACTION OR MONEY BACK GUARANTEE, try it risk-free. LIFETIME WARRANTY against defect. Renowned Dalstrong customer service. See why chef's around the world trust and love, 'The Dalstrong Difference'. Dalstrong luxury packaging. Now you are slicing with POWER. Dalstrong POWER!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u7CMqnkuS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dalstrong","source_asin":"B08P6D6BMT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P6D6BMT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P6D6BMT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
