window.products.push({"id":989666,"name":"Garlic Crusher Grinder Unbreakable Plastic Multi Crusher Crush Pill Crusher and Grinder Garlic Crusher, Garlic Mincer, and Silicone Garlic Peeler Easy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bRpx3ntAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Garlic twister presser Mincing teeth are beveled in both directions for more efficient cutting,that can mince all kinds of ingredients,also great for chili /ginger/olives. Manual twister requires no cutting or pressing place garlic in container Just twist to effortlessly grind garlic cloves into perfectly minced bits. Easily disassemble for simple hand washing in sink. Small handheld garlic machine great for home cooking food prep. Perfect for mincing garlic, ginger, nuts, shallots, olives, and more! Mix garlic and ginger for a perfect stir-fry, or throw in some herbs for your freshest rub. Break out your second Garlic Twister for nuts","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41bRpx3ntAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHRIYA","source_asin":"B0852KTSSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0852KTSSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0852KTSSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":989667,"name":"thatsArte.com - Italian Ceramic Mugs from Deruta Set of 4 - Hand Made Pottery Coffee Mugs, Deruta Italian Pottery, Painted Mug, Italian Ceramic, Made ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ioU1NrK8L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"These handmade and hand-painted mugs are part of the Deruta dinnerware and kitchenware collections handmade by Fima. The family-run company has an excellent reputation for its classic Italian ceramics, thanks to their intricate, carefully hand-painted details. Deruta is a small Umbrian town very well known worldwide for its handmade pottery quality and beauty. It can be considered one of the most vital and productive Italian ceramics centers since the Italian Renaissance in the 15th century. Deruta has been famous for its pottery for centuries. During the Italian Renaissance, the vibrant creativity and impeccable execution of its ceramics attracted noblemen and wealthy merchants who took pride in collecting them. Most of those fantastic art pieces are now displayed in art museums on both sides of the pond.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ioU1NrK8L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"thatsArte.com","source_asin":"B09MSKZMSY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MSKZMSY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MSKZMSY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":989668,"name":"Department 56 Snowbabies Dream a Winter's Nap Figurine, 4.25 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hK+a+cXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For over 27 years Department 56 artist, Kristi Jensen Pierro has captured the beauty and splendor of winter. Her personal experiences and interpretations of childhood are artfully designed into each Snowbabies' piece and carefully named to ensure a sentiment of love, friendship or inspiration. The new SnowDream collection is inspired by a winter walk in the woods with icy colors of white, pink, grey and cool taupe. Each piece is sprinkled with glitter creating a magical effect. \"As an artist my job is to invent. After a year of sketching and conceptualizing I created this new collection. It's a nostalgic collection of figural giftware and trim full of warmth, whimsy and magic. It combines the simple elegance of bisque porcelain with glitter, shiny mica and tinsel. I love the results and I hope that collectors will, too!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hK+a+cXwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B00AXS4LL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989668","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AXS4LL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AXS4LL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
