window.products.push({"id":989702,"name":"Moondream Sound Insulation Curtain, 3-in-1 Noise-Blackout-Thermal Insulation, Patented Technology, 55\" Width x 63\" Length, White (Snow MC720), Rod Poc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21w5KI+ewML._AC_.jpg","description":"Soundproof curtain The Moondream White Soundproof Curtain is a three-in-one technical insulation solution that dresses windows with stylish fabrics and gives you the option to reduce sound levels up to 7 decibels* . Product benefits: - Sound levels reduced up to four-fold, reaching a drop of up to 7 decibels* and Reduction of the reverberation of sound in the room, for a cosy, warm atmosphere. (For a surface area of approximately 215 square feet (20m²°, the reverberation time is reduced by 0.4 seconds)*- Reduction in energy costs: up to 37% drop in central heating costs* and a drop in temperature during summer*- 100% Blackout Effect*- Two hanging options : Rod Pocket or Pencil Pleats- Rod Pocket curtain can fit any rod up to 1.2\" inches- Pencil pleat consists of tightly gathered folds (Plastic hooks furnished). Each Pencil Pleat panel is sewn with 2.8 inches pencil pleat curtain tape- Adjustable curtain thanks to an iron-on-tape (provided) - Bottom sewn with an overcast seam- Reinforced top section, made without stitching, provides a flawless overall appearance. Seamless effect and discreet stitching Product characteristics: - Function: Soundproof, blackout, thermal insulation- Size: 55\" Width x 63\" Length- Care: - Material: *Test performed by Kietudes in compliance with EN ISO 10052 // *Test performed by ENVEHO test report no. M101 dated 09/02/2009 // *Test performed by ENVEHO test report no. 154 dated 05/25/2010 // *Technology Patented US Patent No 9,475,260 / Patent pending Canada : 2-804-571 // *Test by the Experimental Center for Building and Public Works Research and Studies (CEBTP), experimental report no. BEB2.E.6039-1 (* or ** Contact us for more technical informations)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21w5KI+ewML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moondream","source_asin":"B07C91MFR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C91MFR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C91MFR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
