window.products.push({"id":989763,"name":"Neck Pillow, Memory Foam Pillow for Neck and Shoulder Pain Relief, Ergonomic Cervical Pillow for Neck Pain, Orthopedic Contour Pillow for Side Sleeper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mWH3PlEnL._AC_SL1268_.jpg","description":"Relieve Neck and Shoulder Pain - This memory foam neck pillow is made of high quality memory foam with moderate hardness to ensure a comfortable support while sleeping, relaxing the neck pain and shoulder stiffness. Proven contour design perfectly supports and aligns your head, neck, shoulder, and back.Relaxing the neck pain and shoulder stiffness, helping you sleep through the night neck pain-free, and gently stretching and relieving your shoulder muscles, while supporting your neck. Ergonomic Design - The ergonomic memory foam pillow is designed with cervical contour and central cavity meet the needs of the cervix contour.It fits the neck curve, allowing the neck to bend naturally. The spine, head and neck area are ideally and correctly supported.Special armrests of orthopedic pillows support the arms and give your top arm a place to rest. Ideal Pillow for Side Sleeper and Back Stomach Sleeper - The Butterfly-shaped orthopedic pillows is very suitable for different people. When you sleep on your back, the natural traction of the neck and head support can reduce the pressure on the posterior skull, reduce snoring and improve sleep quality.And when you place the arm on the armrests can reduce the numbness. Premium Memory Foam Pillow - The contour pillow is made of 100% polyurethane,super soft and breathable,slow rebound it's shape within a few seconds. Pillowcase is made of 38% bamboo fiber and 62% polyester fiber, which are breathable and skin-friendly, meeting the needs of most people for fabrics. It is a detachable zipper and machine washable, durable and resilient, easy to clean and keep hygiene. All material are chemical free for better health. Worry Free With 100% Satisfaction - Finding a great memory foam neck pillow that can help reduce your cervical problems is an efficient way to improve your sleep each night. We can guarantee that you will not be disappointed considering the many outstanding features it has to offer. We provide a 100% satisfaction solution in the rare case you do not enjoy the product, if you need any assistance, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mWH3PlEnL._AC_SL1268_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Taowon","source_asin":"B0993N4X1Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0993N4X1Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0993N4X1Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
