window.products.push({"id":989897,"name":"Looffy Memory Foam Cervical Pillow, Contour Pillow for Neck Pain Cervical Bed Pillow for Side Sleepers Orthopedic Pillows Neck Support Pillow for Neck","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5ooB5OEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MEMORY FOAM-GREAT COMFORT】Is your bed pillow too soft to support your head? Is your contour pillow too stiff that can hurt your face and ears? Looffy's cervical pillows for neck pain is made of high-density slow rebound memory foam. This neck pillows will provide sleeping firm support with amazing comfort and softness. Our medium firm memory foam provides just the right balance between support and comfort for the most restful sleep allowing you to breathe more freely and reduce snoring. 【REDUCE SLEEPING PAIN NECK PILLOW】Will you get serious headache, sore shoulder or spine pressure after one night sleeping? The unique shape of cervical pillows for neck pain will reduce your sleeping pain and let you get full energy in the morning. The neck pillow's ergonomic design can alleviate shoulder stiffness, promote proper spine alignment, and relax your muscles. What's more, the special armrests neck pillow can give your arms a good rest no matter you're a back, side or stomach sleeper. 【SLEEP HEALTHY & SAFELY】Compared with traditional memory foam neck pillows, our breathable memory foam neck pillow case provide better air circulation to keep you cool and dry, especially when the weather is hot and wet. The neck pillow case is removable with zippered and machine washable, so you can always keep it clean and smelling fresh. 【USING TIPS of CERVICAL PILLOWS】1) If you are new to a neck cervical pillow, it may take time to get used to it. 2) The memory foam cervical pillow will help relieve your neck and back pain to improve the sleeping quality, but it will not eliminate the pain. 3) There may be a light natural foam smell after opening the package. If the smell bothers you, please wash the pillowcase before using it and put the memory foam neck bed pillow outdoor or near an open window around 5-7 days. 【SWEET & WARM GIFT】A good night's sleep is hard to come by. We work all day, deal with the kids, and maybe even get some alone time before settling down into bed and closing your eyes. But sleep just doesn't come. Why not get a memory foam cervical pillow as a christams gift or birthday gift for yourself, your parents, colleagues and friends. The Looffy contour pillow for neck would be a really sweet gift to let them have a good sleeping over the night.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G5ooB5OEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Looffy","source_asin":"B08FX679YS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FX679YS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FX679YS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
