window.products.push({"id":989940,"name":"B’WELL Glass Cups – Coffee Travel Mug – Reusable Coffee Cup – Glass Travel Mug – Tea Travel Mug – Silicone Lid & Base – Hot And Cold Drinks – Dishwash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716M51eql3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"By using a glass reusable coffee mug you will prevent unnecessary plastic pollution and you will positively support the environment. Moreover, a reusable glass coffee cup looks way more stylish and elegant than disposable coffee cups and healthier than any other materials. Why is Borosilicate Glass better than regular glass? - Not all glass is created equally. The Borosilicate glass is thermal shock resistant - It will not become cloudy over time; the glass will be as clear as the day you bought it - It’s lighter than regular glass - The Glass will not produce condensation on the outer layer when filled with a cold beverage - It makes drinks taste better. When you use borosilicate glass the liquid inside remains pure, because borosilicate glass has low solubility, keeping your beverage contaminant free - In terms of overall performance, borosilicate glass is far superior to regular glass. Because of its durability and resistance to chemical changes, it has been traditionally used in chemistry labs as well as for kitchenware and premium glasses. Borosilicate glass is a significant upgrade from traditional glass, and because of its superior quality, it is often priced higher -For your drinking pleasure, our Double Wall Glass Cups are insulated to keep your drinks hot or cold for extended periods of time. In addition, the double wall glass structure ensures that the glass remains cool to touch! Beverages appear to float inside the inner layer of the clear glass. Moreover, the silicone lid & base are made up of 100% food-grade silicone, non-toxic and Eco-friendly with an attractive, ergonomic and practical design. An eco-friendly reusable glass cup is just one step we can take towards a smarter & more sustainable lifestyle. Replace your disposable single use cups, with the innovative B’WELL reusable travel cups! It is time to change the way you drink!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716M51eql3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"B'WELL","source_asin":"B07HLGRBFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HLGRBFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HLGRBFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":989941,"name":"ReaLife Machine Washable Rug - Stain Resistant - Eco-Friendly, Non-Slip, Family & Pet Friendly - Made from Premium Recycled Fibers - Cora Distressed V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FDyTWW4UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ReaLife Rug’s mission is to offer the highest quality rugs at a price that is competitive with those of lesser quality. These beautiful rugs are crafted to add a personal touch and delightful look to any area of your home. They are flat woven, without pile or nap, and made from premium recycled materials in the interest of preserving the environment and sustainability. ReaLife Rugs further makes a difference by creating jobs for skilled artisans who would have otherwise faced unemployment. Our rugs not only enrich your home but also the lives of those that made them. Care Instructions: Machine wash cold in front-load washer then dry using air-only setting without heat. Washing larger size rugs in a commercial-laundromat size front-load machine is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91FDyTWW4UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ReaLife Rugs","source_asin":"B08K3Q87S3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-989941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K3Q87S3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K3Q87S3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
